OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor, who had cerebral palsy, drew
OL,7,Fon his own experience for his role as
OL,8,FWalter 'Flynn' White Jr in the
OL,9,FEmmy-winning drama series. Bryan
OL,10,FCranston, who played his father, paid
OL,11,Ftribute on Instagram, writing that he
OL,12,Fwas in "deep despair" following the
OL,13,Fnews.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
